<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - HFS, CUC International cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - HFS, CUC International cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said it downgraded CUC International Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said its proposed merger partner, Bankers Trust, downgraded HFS Inc to market perform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- On Tuesday, HFS and CUC International announced plans to merge in a deal valued at about $11 billion.</p>
